<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DriveX · Frequently Asked Questions</title>

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/base.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/faq.css">
</head>

<body class="faq-body">
  <div class="faq-wrapper">

    <!-- HEADER (igual estilo) -->
    <header class="main-header glass-panel">
      <div class="header-container">

        <div class="header-left">
          <a href="/" class="logo">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="DriveX logo">
            <span>DriveX</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="header-right">
          <a href="/favourites" class="nav-icon-link" title="Favourites" aria-label="Favourites">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.568L24 9.748l-6 5.848L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.596 0 9.748l8.332-1.593z" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <div class="auth-buttons">
            <% if (!user) { %>
              <a href="/login" class="btn-premium primary header-cta">Log in</a>
            <% } else { %>
              <div class="user-profile">
                <span class="user-name"><%= user.name %></span>
                <a href="/logout" class="btn-premium secondary header-cta">Sign out</a>
              </div>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="header-nav">
          <nav class="main-nav">
            <a href="/" id="home" class="nav-link">Home</a>
            <a href="/aboutUs" id="aboutUs" class="nav-link">About Us</a>
            <a href="/frequentlyAskedQuestions" id="frequentlyAskedQuestions" class="nav-link active">Frequently Asked Questions</a>
            <a href="/contact" id="contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
            <% if (user && user.role=="Admin" ){ %>
              <a href="/users" class="nav-link admin-link">Admin</a>
            <% } %>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <!-- Aquí no hace falta search, pero si quieres mantener el hueco -->
        <div class="header-search">
          <div class="search-placeholder"></div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN -->
    <main class="faq-main">
      <section class="faq-hero glass-panel">
        <div class="faq-hero-text">
          <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
          <p>
            Everything you need to know about DriveX: how we select our vehicles, how offers work, favourites,
            contact and purchase process.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-hero-card">
          <h3>About our dealership</h3>
          <p>
            DriveX is a premium vehicle catalogue built in Málaga by <strong>Los Del Fondo Devs</strong>.
            We focus on transparency, quality listings and a clean, fast browsing experience.
          </p>
          <ul class="faq-bullets">
            <li>Verified listings & high-quality photos</li>
            <li>Offers highlighted for quick discovery</li>
            <li>Favourites to save what you love</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-premium primary">Contact us</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="faq-content">
        <div class="faq-grid">

          <!-- BUYING -->
          <article class="faq-section glass-panel">
            <h2>Buying & process</h2>

            <details class="faq-item" open>
              <summary>How do I buy a vehicle on DriveX?</summary>
              <p>
                Browse the catalogue, open the vehicle details and contact us. We’ll guide you with availability,
                reservation steps, documentation and delivery options.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Are vehicles inspected?</summary>
              <p>
                Yes. We prioritize listings that include clear images, detailed descriptions and key specs.
                For selected vehicles we also include extra verification and history details when available.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Can I reserve a vehicle?</summary>
              <p>
                In most cases yes. Contact us with the listing link and we’ll confirm the reservation conditions
                and timeframe.
              </p>
            </details>
          </article>

          <!-- OFFERS -->
          <article class="faq-section glass-panel">
            <h2>Offers</h2>

            <details class="faq-item" open>
              <summary>What does the “OFFER” badge mean?</summary>
              <p>
                “OFFER” indicates a special price, limited-time deal or a discounted unit. You can also browse all offers
                from the Offers section.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>How often do offers change?</summary>
              <p>
                Offers may change depending on stock, promotions, or seasonal campaigns. If you like a vehicle,
                save it to favourites to keep it on your radar.
              </p>
            </details>
          </article>

          <!-- ACCOUNT -->
          <article class="faq-section glass-panel">
            <h2>Account & favourites</h2>

            <details class="faq-item" open>
              <summary>Why do I need to log in?</summary>
              <p>
                Logging in unlocks full functionality like favourites. It also helps us keep a cleaner and safer experience.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>How do favourites work?</summary>
              <p>
                When you’re logged in, tap the star on a vehicle card. It will be saved in your favourites list so you can
                compare options later.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>I forgot my password. What can I do?</summary>
              <p>
                For now, contact our team and we’ll help you recover access. (We’re working on a self-service reset feature.)
              </p>
            </details>
          </article>

          <!-- SECURITY -->
          <article class="faq-section glass-panel">
            <h2>Security & trust</h2>

            <details class="faq-item" open>
              <summary>Is my data safe?</summary>
              <p>
                We store only what we need to provide the service, and we use secure practices to protect user credentials.
                Never share your password with anyone.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>How do you avoid scam listings?</summary>
              <p>
                We prioritize quality listings and consistent data. If you ever spot something suspicious, report it via Contact.
              </p>
            </details>
          </article>

        </div>

        <div class="faq-cta glass-panel">
          <div>
            <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
            <p>
              Reach out and we’ll reply as soon as possible. Tell us the vehicle link (if any) and what you need.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-premium primary">Go to Contact</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="faq-footer">
      <p>DriveX is a creation of Los Del Fondo Devs. All rights reserved. Malaga, 2025.</p>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>

</html>